  "releaseNotes": "Added vector MinNumber and MaxNumber operations, improved missing-aware vector performance and consistency, and expanded support across reductions, pairwise operations, and vector–scalar operations. Added Jarque–Bera, D’Agostino–Pearson, Wilcoxon signed-rank, Friedman, and KPSS statistical tests, along with PValueStatus for bounded table-based p-values.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": "Numerics.NET - math, statistics, and data analysis libraries for .NET.",
